{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Bidi, digit and tokenizer strings for the shared conformance suites (CONTRACT section 3.3). `expect` gives the non-space tokens (kind, text), the merged LTR runs, the word count, the digit system detected, and the text-gate findings (N1/B1 ids, plus ORTHO-DIG-004 for glued digits) under `digitsSetting` (default western). U+00A0 is written as \\u00a0 in the JSON.",
  "source": "docs/CONTRACT.md sections 3.3 and 7.2",
